//             -M NO_H1                withhold part_of temporal containment

//             -M HDCA                 check HDCA tissue annotations (hdca.dl)
//             -M EHDAA2               import EHDAA2 bounds for HDCA terms (ehdaa2.dl)
//             -M EHDAA2_INTENDED      ... read as "starts during" / "ends during"

